    "text": "I, Gamalathge Dilip Nishantha, Returning Officer of the Polgahawela Pradeshiya Sabha, do hereby declare under Section10A(1)(a) of the (Chapter 262) Local Authorities Elections Ordinance that Mr. Nishshanka Dhanushka Rathnajeewa PushpaKumara of the Polgahawela Pradeshiya Sabha has vacated his office of member of that Pradeshiya Sabha as he has ceasedto be a member of the United People\u2019s Freedom Alliance.",
